sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as anomaly-detector loop
    participant MW as MetricWindow
    participant DB as Database
    participant BUS as EventBus
    participant UI as UI

    L->>MW: push(value, ts) per series
    L->>MW: forecast(horizon_steps)  [Holt damped-trend]
    MW->>MW: guard: min points / fit MAPE / flatness / confidence
    alt breach predicted within horizon & cooldown ok
        MW-->>L: {breach_at, band, confidence}
        L->>DB: INSERT Anomaly(kind=predicted, prediction_status=pending)
        L->>BUS: publish("anomalies", predicted)
        BUS->>UI: purple "Predicted incidents" banner
    end
    Note over L: later sweeps
    L->>L: _reconcile_predictions()
    L->>DB: mark confirmed | expired
